<title>UK: Rugby Estates appoints Taylor as director.</title>
<headline>Rugby Estates appoints Taylor as director.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property company Rugby Estates Plc said on Tuesday it had appointed Neal Taylor as a board director with effect from today.</p>
<p>Taylor joined the group in 1992 from Hillier Parker. As an associate director, Taylor has been responsible for property acquisitions, sales and portfolio management and he will continue with these tasks in his new role, said the company.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
